      <div class="step"><div class="step-n"></div><div class="stack-sm"><h3>Tell us your situation</h3><p>A phone call with a person, not a form. Fifteen minutes. We ask where the family lived, what the work was, and what the diagnosis is.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-n"></div><div class="stack-sm"><h3>We give you a straight answer</h3><p>Including a fast no. If we do not think this is worth pursuing, we say so on that first call rather than signing you up and letting you find out in a year.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-n"></div><div class="stack-sm"><h3>We gather the records</h3><p>Residency, employment, medical, death certificate, proof of relationship. This is the part that takes months and it is the reason most people call us.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-n"></div><div class="stack-sm"><h3>The claim gets filed</h3><p>Before the federal deadline. Then we keep you updated while it is under review.</p></div></div>
